(7545608, 1207804, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific portrait of this coyote (and not a wolf, I guess).  No posing here, just the entirety of her/his being.  The steadfast gaze gives no quarter.  The focus is perfect.  A great image.</td>', 'Terrific portrait of this coyote (and not a wolf, I guess).  No posing here, just the entirety of her/his being.  The steadfast gaze gives no quarter.  The focus is perfect.  A great image.', '2017-11-20 15:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545620, 1208070, 173844, '<td valign="top">An air of nonchalance and confidence is shown in this fine portrait.  Without effort she fully inhabits the frame.  I like how the top of her face and her right shoulder are so bright, forcefully contrasting with underside shadows.  This brings her forward.  Her hair, aside from those spiraling tendrils, is allowed to blend with the background, nonchalance and confidence on the part of the photographer.  The extent of the scratches, in support of the overall mood, seems warranted.  I want to know what she''s feeling.  <br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'An air of nonchalance and confidence is shown in this fine portrait.  Without effort she fully inhabits the frame.  I like how the top of her face and her right shoulder are so bright, forcefully contrasting with underside shadows.  This brings her forward.  Her hair, aside from those spiraling tendrils, is allowed to blend with the background, nonchalance and confidence on the part of the photographer.  The extent of the scratches, in support of the overall mood, seems warranted.  I want to know what she''s feeling.  Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2017-11-20 16:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545621, 1207887, 173844, '<td valign="top">Of all the wonderful images in this challenge, I enjoy this one the most.  Her face, which feels far from posed, radiates warmth and kindness.  She''s taking real pleasure in her work with the skeletal dolls, which softens the divide.  There''s a sense of ritual here, of celebration.  Also a sense of serenity.  The black border is subtle and complementary.  So fine.</td>', 'Of all the wonderful images in this challenge, I enjoy this one the most.  Her face, which feels far from posed, radiates warmth and kindness.  She''s taking real pleasure in her work with the skeletal dolls, which softens the divide.  There''s a sense of ritual here, of celebration.  Also a sense of serenity.  The black border is subtle and complementary.  So fine.', '2017-11-20 17:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545623, 1207916, 173844, '<td valign="top">Both soft and dramatic.  I can''t be sure of gender or age, but he/she seems to be a thoughtful soul.  The lighting, the chiaroscuro effect, determines the impact of the image, which I feel is strong.  Also, a commentary on race might (or might not, for that matter) be being undertaken.  Something like, I can be made to look different, by ignorance, lack of empathy, camera lighting, but I am just who I am, like you and you and you. The tones are deftly handled, especially in the intergrading of dark and light.  Beautiful liquid eyes.  I think the framing choice works quite well.  Nice title.  <br/>A fine, compelling image.</td>', 'Both soft and dramatic.  I can''t be sure of gender or age, but he/she seems to be a thoughtful soul.  The lighting, the chiaroscuro effect, determines the impact of the image, which I feel is strong.  Also, a commentary on race might (or might not, for that matter) be being undertaken.  Something like, I can be made to look different, by ignorance, lack of empathy, camera lighting, but I am just who I am, like you and you and you. The tones are deftly handled, especially in the intergrading of dark and light.  Beautiful liquid eyes.  I think the framing choice works quite well.  Nice title.  A fine, compelling image.', '2017-11-20 17:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
