(7545683, 1208066, 173844, '<td valign="top">Her natural delicacy and grace are quite winning, the movement of the wind.  She''s comfortably situated between the strength and detail of the logs upon which she balances and the hazy background.  Her smile is natural and happy.  Her shirt confused me at first because I''m constantly assured that Subaru is love, and nothing so frivolous as children, but I guess we can share.<br/>Fine image.</td>', 'Her natural delicacy and grace are quite winning, the movement of the wind.  She''s comfortably situated between the strength and detail of the logs upon which she balances and the hazy background.  Her smile is natural and happy.  Her shirt confused me at first because I''m constantly assured that Subaru is love, and nothing so frivolous as children, but I guess we can share.Fine image.', '2017-11-21 16:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545685, 1208237, 173844, '<td valign="top">First, I love that she has a bright lamp on her forehead --  it establishes her personality, intrepid and determined.  With no background to speak of, only darkness, and minimalist clothing with but a dab of texture, her face is all that''s there, and it absolutely commands appreciation and admiration.  Creative, strong image.</td>', 'First, I love that she has a bright lamp on her forehead --  it establishes her personality, intrepid and determined.  With no background to speak of, only darkness, and minimalist clothing with but a dab of texture, her face is all that''s there, and it absolutely commands appreciation and admiration.  Creative, strong image.', '2017-11-21 16:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545686, 1208154, 173844, '<td valign="top">Charming.  She''s all that concentrated emotion packed into the only focused part of the photo.  Such joy can empower the universe.  This image hits you like a locomotive.  Terrific, impressive picture.</td>', 'Charming.  She''s all that concentrated emotion packed into the only focused part of the photo.  Such joy can empower the universe.  This image hits you like a locomotive.  Terrific, impressive picture.', '2017-11-21 16:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545688, 1208131, 173844, '<td valign="top">The forward son is sturdy and sharp, the father is a bit uncertain and of diminished focus.  Herein lies the story, which expands the image from portrait to saga, perhaps to overstate it a bit.  Well-rounded, brash image.</td>', 'The forward son is sturdy and sharp, the father is a bit uncertain and of diminished focus.  Herein lies the story, which expands the image from portrait to saga, perhaps to overstate it a bit.  Well-rounded, brash image.', '2017-11-21 16:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545689, 1208050, 173844, '<td valign="top">He''s caught in a moment of suspicion, annoyance, distrust, and his face displays this hodgepodge of emotions washing through him.  His hands are also eloquent against the dark cloth he''s holding.  The overall graininess works well with the rawness of his feelings, and cooperates with the background wall.  The composition is sturdy.  Beautiful image.</td>', 'He''s caught in a moment of suspicion, annoyance, distrust, and his face displays this hodgepodge of emotions washing through him.  His hands are also eloquent against the dark cloth he''s holding.  The overall graininess works well with the rawness of his feelings, and cooperates with the background wall.  The composition is sturdy.  Beautiful image.', '2017-11-21 16:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
