(7545699, 1207973, 173844, '<td valign="top">A concentrated image that seems to be a distillation of this man''s determined nature.  Looking straight into the camera, his glasses, which can hide person, here hides nothing.  I like the plain-spoken rawness.  The title seems to be a deliberate attempt at understatement, but it doesn''t work -  not at all a criticism.  And I''ve learned that what I''ve always called a beanie also leads a hitherto unknown sophisticated existence.  Fine portrait.</td>', 'A concentrated image that seems to be a distillation of this man''s determined nature.  Looking straight into the camera, his glasses, which can hide person, here hides nothing.  I like the plain-spoken rawness.  The title seems to be a deliberate attempt at understatement, but it doesn''t work -  not at all a criticism.  And I''ve learned that what I''ve always called a beanie also leads a hitherto unknown sophisticated existence.  Fine portrait.', '2017-11-21 16:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
