(7545707, 1208142, 173844, '<td valign="top">His face and hands express deep experience.  The foreground and background are casual and unpretentious, as he is too.  Every crease and crag is lovingly presented.  I like this quietly dynamic portrait.<br/>A question about the title --  why wouldn''t he be a gentleman inside?  Clothing and character needn''t be at odds.</td>', 'His face and hands express deep experience.  The foreground and background are casual and unpretentious, as he is too.  Every crease and crag is lovingly presented.  I like this quietly dynamic portrait.A question about the title --  why wouldn''t he be a gentleman inside?  Clothing and character needn''t be at odds.', '2017-11-21 17:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
