(7545749, 1207897, 173844, '<td valign="top">Anything but a cat, this would evoke baffling wonderment.  A cat, par for the course.  Lots of intensity here, in the eyes and the startling whiskers.  Nice, compact portrait.</td>', 'Anything but a cat, this would evoke baffling wonderment.  A cat, par for the course.  Lots of intensity here, in the eyes and the startling whiskers.  Nice, compact portrait.', '2017-11-21 20:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545750, 1208195, 173844, '<td valign="top">A straightforward portrait.  I like the high key appearance of the upper half, which seems to float above the more solid coat and turtleneck.  It''s a very interesting effect.  Good image.</td>', 'A straightforward portrait.  I like the high key appearance of the upper half, which seems to float above the more solid coat and turtleneck.  It''s a very interesting effect.  Good image.', '2017-11-21 20:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545751, 1208211, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  She seems engaged and connected to the world, while still insisting on a bit of reserve.  I get the latter from the placement of her hand, but am afraid I''m being too much of a pop psychologist.  I like how well she fills the frame and the kindness in her eyes.</td>', 'Very nice image.  She seems engaged and connected to the world, while still insisting on a bit of reserve.  I get the latter from the placement of her hand, but am afraid I''m being too much of a pop psychologist.  I like how well she fills the frame and the kindness in her eyes.', '2017-11-21 20:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545753, 1208241, 173844, '<td valign="top">She seems to be a reluctant bride.  It''s this tension that animates the image.  Her skin appears a bit blotchy, maybe due to the lighting, shadows thrown from the tulle.  While interesting, I also find it disturbing.</td>', 'She seems to be a reluctant bride.  It''s this tension that animates the image.  Her skin appears a bit blotchy, maybe due to the lighting, shadows thrown from the tulle.  While interesting, I also find it disturbing.', '2017-11-21 20:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545754, 1208199, 173844, '<td valign="top">We can all identify with this.  While the hands over the face certainly convey the feeling, I even more appreciate the blurring and dissolution everywhere else, an undertone that supports the obvious.  His hands are very handsomely presented.  Nice image.<br/>(I had thought of doing a similar pose, entitling it "News at 7.")</td>', 'We can all identify with this.  While the hands over the face certainly convey the feeling, I even more appreciate the blurring and dissolution everywhere else, an undertone that supports the obvious.  His hands are very handsomely presented.  Nice image.(I had thought of doing a similar pose, entitling it "News at 7.")', '2017-11-21 20:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545755, 1208193, 173844, '<td valign="top">Creative and engaging.  Hangs together stylistically, but I find the sign to be jarring... maybe intentionally so.  But here is a portrait that goes way beyond someone just standing before a camera, and I''ve spent a good amount of time pondering it, enjoyably so.</td>', 'Creative and engaging.  Hangs together stylistically, but I find the sign to be jarring... maybe intentionally so.  But here is a portrait that goes way beyond someone just standing before a camera, and I''ve spent a good amount of time pondering it, enjoyably so.', '2017-11-21 20:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545756, 1208052, 173844, '<td valign="top">d</td>', 'd', '2017-11-21 20:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545760, 1208197, 173844, '<td valign="top">Good portrait of a man who seems to have spent some time standing against the wind -  in a character-building way.  Soft, ruminative eyes (in a deep thinking way, not in a chewing the cud way).  While I like the patterns of the foliage background, it also is somewhat confusing.  There''s a kind of chameleon effect that I like, and gives the image a visual resonance.</td>', 'Good portrait of a man who seems to have spent some time standing against the wind -  in a character-building way.  Soft, ruminative eyes (in a deep thinking way, not in a chewing the cud way).  While I like the patterns of the foliage background, it also is somewhat confusing.  There''s a kind of chameleon effect that I like, and gives the image a visual resonance.', '2017-11-21 20:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545763, 1207794, 173844, '<td valign="top">A nice, kind, giving face that needs no visual accoutrements to elevate it.  The field of bokeh does a fine job.  It''s this simple approach that I find so appealing, but it can only come off on the basis of a strong subject, as it does here.  Fine image.</td>', 'A nice, kind, giving face that needs no visual accoutrements to elevate it.  The field of bokeh does a fine job.  It''s this simple approach that I find so appealing, but it can only come off on the basis of a strong subject, as it does here.  Fine image.', '2017-11-21 20:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545766, 1207803, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like this man''s solidity and clear gaze.  His dark garb against the neutral background draws attention to his face, which is nicely lit and well-placed in a balanced composition.  Good image.</td>', 'I like this man''s solidity and clear gaze.  His dark garb against the neutral background draws attention to his face, which is nicely lit and well-placed in a balanced composition.  Good image.', '2017-11-21 21:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545768, 1208036, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and composition choices here.  Lots of shadow, a flare of light against which the subject is positioned.  I don''t know if the expression is one of boredom, rumination or fit of pique, which holds one attention.  A strong image.</td>', 'I like the lighting and composition choices here.  Lots of shadow, a flare of light against which the subject is positioned.  I don''t know if the expression is one of boredom, rumination or fit of pique, which holds one attention.  A strong image.', '2017-11-21 21:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545769, 1208176, 30049, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  Gallery ready.</td>', 'Awesome.  Gallery ready.', '2017-11-21 21:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545770, 1208194, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice emotion captured here.  Lighting spot on ... etc.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice emotion captured here.  Lighting spot on ... etc.  Well done.', '2017-11-21 21:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545771, 1207803, 30049, '<td valign="top">Feels like a stare down with the camera.  LOL  But, still a nice portrait and a top vote.</td>', 'Feels like a stare down with the camera.  LOL  But, still a nice portrait and a top vote.', '2017-11-21 21:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545772, 1208214, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of apparel.  Highlights the person well.</td>', 'I like the choice of apparel.  Highlights the person well.', '2017-11-21 21:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545773, 1207973, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like this guy and I don''t even know him.  :-)  Well done.</td>', 'I like this guy and I don''t even know him.  :-)  Well done.', '2017-11-21 21:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545774, 1208161, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the edge this has without getting all worked up with photoshop textures, etc...  Very well done.  Awesome choice of location.</td>', 'I like the edge this has without getting all worked up with photoshop textures, etc...  Very well done.  Awesome choice of location.', '2017-11-21 21:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
