(7545820, 1208214, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice reflective portrait, casual and comfortable.  I like the softer black against the deeper black.  While the dungarees add a down to earth touch, as a tonal area it''s kind of looming.  An overall gentle quality pervades the image, which is appealing.</td>', 'Nice reflective portrait, casual and comfortable.  I like the softer black against the deeper black.  While the dungarees add a down to earth touch, as a tonal area it''s kind of looming.  An overall gentle quality pervades the image, which is appealing.', '2017-11-21 22:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545821, 1208094, 67697, '<td valign="top">Love this one. I can''t get enough of it. He''s adorable!</td>', 'Love this one. I can''t get enough of it. He''s adorable!', '2017-11-21 22:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545822, 1207821, 67697, '<td valign="top">I am amazed you got the pup to sit still in costume. He or she is adorable.</td>', 'I am amazed you got the pup to sit still in costume. He or she is adorable.', '2017-11-21 22:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545823, 1208156, 67697, '<td valign="top">Great lighting. Nice getting a sneak peek of his eyes with a hint of dare in them.</td>', 'Great lighting. Nice getting a sneak peek of his eyes with a hint of dare in them.', '2017-11-21 22:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545824, 1208080, 173844, '<td valign="top">The raindrops on glass make an interesting foreground, and even create a sort of aura around his head.  They break up his direct gaze, bringing out an air of reflection.  I like the composition, a fine example of the rule of thirds, and all that dark area on the right.  A fine portrait elevated by playful creativity.</td>', 'The raindrops on glass make an interesting foreground, and even create a sort of aura around his head.  They break up his direct gaze, bringing out an air of reflection.  I like the composition, a fine example of the rule of thirds, and all that dark area on the right.  A fine portrait elevated by playful creativity.', '2017-11-21 22:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545825, 1207794, 67697, '<td valign="top">It''s like you''ve captured his true essence. I love that natural smile.</td>', 'It''s like you''ve captured his true essence. I love that natural smile.', '2017-11-21 22:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545826, 1208111, 67697, '<td valign="top">The processing fits so well with their costumes. They are truly in character.</td>', 'The processing fits so well with their costumes. They are truly in character.', '2017-11-21 22:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7545827, 1207897, 67697, '<td valign="top">Beautiful kitty and lovely portrait.</td>', 'Beautiful kitty and lovely portrait.', '2017-11-21 22:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
