(7545836, 1207900, 173844, '<td valign="top">An offhand glance as he turns to the camera while appearing turned inward.  It seems like a moment on a difficult trek.  The scratchiness adds to the documentary feel and the sense that this isn''t a recent instance.  Could be 1936.  He seems reluctant to come forward out of the brilliant background.  Affecting image.</td>', 'An offhand glance as he turns to the camera while appearing turned inward.  It seems like a moment on a difficult trek.  The scratchiness adds to the documentary feel and the sense that this isn''t a recent instance.  Could be 1936.  He seems reluctant to come forward out of the brilliant background.  Affecting image.', '2017-11-21 22:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
