(7545845, 1208149, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very interesting flat-toned image, even Edward Hopperish.  Good composition.  The portrait aspect is beautifully minimal.  The bouquet or umbrella emanating from her head certainly adds a quirky note, but I frankly believe the image is so strong that it is not needed and detracts more than it adds, but that''s the way it was and I respect that and the photographer''s vision.  Fine image.</td>', 'Very interesting flat-toned image, even Edward Hopperish.  Good composition.  The portrait aspect is beautifully minimal.  The bouquet or umbrella emanating from her head certainly adds a quirky note, but I frankly believe the image is so strong that it is not needed and detracts more than it adds, but that''s the way it was and I respect that and the photographer''s vision.  Fine image.', '2017-11-21 23:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
