(7545863, 1207916, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love contrast this intense that still conveys a face with beautiful areas of shadow. I consider this a real technical achievement. and the honesty and directness of the expression is a photographic achievement. I''m hanging this in my fantasy gallery<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I love contrast this intense that still conveys a face with beautiful areas of shadow. I consider this a real technical achievement. and the honesty and directness of the expression is a photographic achievement. I''m hanging this in my fantasy gallery ', '2017-11-21 23:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
